    #- port - optional ZKTeco TCP port. Defaults to 4370 when omitted.
    #- password - optional ZKTeco connection password. Defaults to 0 when omitted.
    #- punch_direction - 'IN'/'OUT'/'AUTO'/None
    #- clear_from_device_on_fetch: if set to true then attendance is deleted after fetch is successful.
                                    # WARNING: keep this False for production unless you have a verified backup and retention process.
    #- latitude - optional float, required only if 'Allow Geolocation Tracking' is enabled in HRMS
    #- longitude - optional float, required only if 'Allow Geolocation Tracking' is enabled in HRMS
